Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Books",
  "type": "Expense"
}

### 3. Create duplicate category (expect 409, R10)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/categories
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "books",
  "type": "Expense"
}

### 4. Rename a system category (expect 403, R11)
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/categories/b0000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000001
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Hacked Food"
}

### 5. Delete a category used by operations (expect 409, R12, using seed Food ID)
